 "strings": [
  "",
  "The AEUG's attack on Jaburo",
  "was an utter failure.",
  "The AEUG had raised the banner",
  "of halting Earth's pollution, yet its",
  "attack had dealt the Amazon,",
  "Earth's last primeval forest,",
  "wounds that could never heal.",
  "Having seized the Audhumla,",
  "the AEUG joined Karaba, Earth's",
  "anti-Earth Federation group,",
  "and returned most of its landed",
  "forces to space.",
  "But Kamille",
  "was to remain on Earth.",
  "It also meant",
  "a meeting with the man",
  "who, though a hero of legend,",
  "had been confined on Earth",
  "for seven years:",
  "Amuro Ray...",
  "Let us go back a little in time.",
  "Amuro Ray, who had been",
  "forced to live in confinement,",
  "with the help of Katz Kobayashi,",
  "adopted son of old friend Hayato,",
  "slipped past his watchers",
  "and joined the Audhumla.",
  "It was, perhaps, the will",
  "of a young man who had spent",
  "seven long years brooding",
  "to try, at any rate,",
  "to face up to reality.",
  "Amuro",
  "\"Could you leave",
  " one mobile suit behind for me?\"",
  "Quattro",
  "\"Not the Mk-II.",
  " Kamille-kun is used to it,",
  " so I can't leave it behind.\"",
  "\"A Rick Dias will do.\"",
  "\"That one was developed",
  " by the AEUG, you know...\"",
  "\"You can't bring yourself",
  " to go up into space?\"",
  "\"Weightlessness... it scares me.\"",
  "\"It's meeting Lalah",
  " that frightens you, isn't it?\"",
  "\"......\"",
  "\"You're afraid that if you go up",
  " into space, you might",
  " meet her again.\"",
  "\"...No.\"",
  "\"While we're alive,",
  " there are things the living",
  " must do.\"",
  "\"Doing them is our offering",
  " to the dead.\"",
  "\"Stop talking!\"",
  "The memory of killing Lalah Sune",
  "with his own hands",
  "had tormented Amuro",
  "for seven years.",
  "A girl with whom he had shared",
  "his very mind, completely--",
  "or so, at least, he believed--",
  "and he had killed her himself.",
  "For a young man as gentle",
  "as Amuro,",
  "it was more than he could bear.",
  "To flatter himself",
  "that if only he had done better...",
  "his insight was far too keen",
  "for that. And to live out his days",
  "cursing Char",
  "for drawing Lalah into the war--",
  "for that,",
  "he understood the man Char",
  "all too well.",
  "And precisely because of that,",
  "his ambivalence twisted him",
  "all the more deeply.",
  "\"Char Aznable...",
  " why did you come back",
  " to the Earth Sphere?\"",
  "\"...I came to laugh at you.",
  " If I say that,",
  " it'll satisfy you, won't it?\"",
  "\"......!\"",
  "But Quattro, belying his words,",
  "left a Rick Dias",
  "behind for Amuro,",
  "and Amuro, too,",
  "climbed into a mobile suit",
  "of his old nemesis' red",
  "and returned to the front.",
  "It was perhaps not the return",
  "of the mythic hero Amuro Ray",
  "who lived in so many",
  "people's imaginations.",
  "Yet the fact remains that Amuro,",
  "a young man of barely twenty,",
  "in order to face reality,",
  "cast off his hermit's life",
  "and took up the fight again.",
  "For there is no doubt",
  "that this led, in later years,",
  "to his flowering",
  "as a Newtype...",
  "And now: New Hong Kong.",
  "Beltorchika",
  "\"I heard the Titans",
  " are dispersing their forces.\"",
  "\"Still, this talk",
  " about New Guinea...\"",
  "\"It's possible.",
  " To get into space, it's better",
  " to be near the equator.\"",
  "Hayato",
  "\"Then there's Africa,",
  " the Middle East, and India, right?\"",
  "\"That's right.\"",
  "\"Besides, the news",
  " of the AEUG's Jaburo invasion",
  " hasn't been reported.\"",
  "\"We need an operation",
  " to put the AEUG on the map...",
  " or we'll be dying for nothing.\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Put the AEUG",
  " on the map?\"",
  "\"That's why",
  " we hit New Guinea.\"",
  "\"Amuro...!\"",
  "\"Well, actually, this is",
  " something Katz was saying.\"",
  "\"New Guinea, just after",
  " they've moved in,",
  " should be easy to hit...\"",
  "\"And they'd have shuttles",
  " for getting up to space...?\"",
  "\"I see.",
  " It's close to Hong Kong, too,",
  " so word would reach the world...\"",
  "(The way he's put it behind him...",
  " That's him, all right...)",
  "\"What do you think, Kamille-kun?\"",
  "\"Huh!?",
  " ...Yes... but",
  " we don't have enough Dodais.\"",
  "\"True. Without those,",
  " we can't fight mobile suit",
  " battles on the ground, can we?\"",
  "\"Then there's nothing for it but",
  " to contact the Luo Company",
  " that Kai put us onto, right?\"",
  "\"Can he be trusted?",
  " This Luo Uu Ming...\"",
  "\"So they say.\"",
  "\"What do you think?\"",
  "\"Whatever we do,",
  " we'll need to resupply, right?\"",
  "\"All right, change course",
  " for New Hong Kong.\"",
  "New Hong Kong",
  "was a strange city: territory",
  "leased to the Earth Federation.",
  "The age of global conflict",
  "before the Universal Century",
  "had given rise to such a city.",
  "Floating on the sea,",
  "a full 30 kilometers long,",
  "a giant linear motor rail--",
  "the mass driver--and",
  "the spaceport that went with it",
  "were, one might say, the whole",
  "of New Hong Kong.",
  "From this spaceport,",
  "billions of people of the Far East",
  "had gone up into space.",
  "Such was the city;",
  "a center of trade",
  "since the Middle Ages,",
  "it had also become a den",
  "of the so-called Hong Kong Mafia,",
  "of money that shunned the light,",
  "and of illegal residents.",
  "Given that history,",
  "though Hong Kong itself might see",
  "the odd skirmish,",
  "its mass driver and economic core",
  "had never been struck,",
  "and it was popular with tourists",
  "as a city that kept its look from",
  "before the space emigration.",
  "Above all, Stephanie,",
  "second wife of Luo Uu Ming,",
  "boss of the Hong Kong Mafia,",
  "was the daughter of Wong Lee,",
  "an AEUG backer.",
  "For the Audhumla to flee to,",
  "it was the best place there was.",
  "Enter\n        Beltorchika Irma",
  "The White Base Crew, Afterward",
  "Enter Beltorchika Irma",
  "A girl named Beltorchika Irma",
  "was an agent of Karaba.",
  "Karaba, as an organization,",
  "is hard to sum up in a word.",
  "A government organization",
  "allied with the AEUG:",
  "so went the official explanation.",
  "But it seems",
  "that was not all there was to it.",
  "Officially, Karaba's leader",
  "was a former White Base crewman,",
  "Hayato Kobayashi,",
  "but he himself never once",
  "did more than serve as captain",
  "of the Audhumla.",
  "And yet Karaba had a network",
  "across the whole Earth, and even",
  "its own mobile suits.",
  "But it was distinct from the AEUG,",
  "and, more than the AEUG, held",
  "to a Robin Hood creed: the people",
  "of Earth would stand against",
  "the Federation's misrule.",
  "Above all, the AEUG, which claimed",
  "to be the Earth Federation Forces,",
  "after a fashion, and Karaba,",
  "a mix of soldiers and civilians,",
  "differed in their very nature.",
  "Karaba was, rather, a body",
  "best called a volunteer army.",
  "Karaba was no army--",
  "so some even insisted.",
  "In this work, we regard Karaba",
  "as born of the self-cleansing",
  "of the people living on Earth.",
  "Disillusioned with the Federation,",
  "Earth's people of conscience",
  "first put their hopes in Zeon, but",
  "Zeon in the end knew nothing but",
  "how to plunder the Earth.",
  "But the Federation's postwar",
  "recovery policy rebuilt an Earth",
  "to suit the privileged few,",
  "neglecting the environment itself.",
  "And this, though meteor showers",
  "of space debris were now routine,",
  "and the soot of two colony drops",
  "still hung over",
  "the blue skies.",
  "Worse still, the Federation",
  "government exploited",
  "the postwar chaos to seize",
  "land by force from the poor",
  "who stayed on Earth",
  "and claim it as its own.",
  "And this, though some of them",
  "had been allowed to live on Earth",
  "to keep their ethnic ways alive.",
  "To those who, around the dawn",
  "of the Universal Century, had",
  "staked their hopes on space,",
  "believing themselves freed from",
  "ethnic and religious strife, this",
  "looked like betraying Earth itself.",
  "That anger joined hands",
  "with the underground world, long",
  "a means of mutual aid",
  "among the downtrodden,",
  "and rose up",
  "to protect the healthy Earth",
  "as it was meant to be: that,",
  "we would like to think, is Karaba.",
  "Beltorchika Irma, it is said,",
  "lost her family in a colony drop",
  "and was taken in by a wealthy",
  "philanthropist.",
  "Her adoptive father was an ardent",
  "supporter of Karaba, so if she",
  "set her heart on her dream hero,",
  "her prince on a white horse,",
  "Amuro Ray,",
  "it was hardly surprising.",
  "\"My, aren't you dedicated.\"",
  "\"Do you want something?\"",
  "\"Can't I talk to you",
  " unless I want something?\"",
  "\"I'm busy.\"",
  "\"Used to it yet?",
  " ...The Gundam Mk-II.\"",
  "\"Yes...\"",
  "\"What counts is how much",
  " real combat you've seen,",
  " in mobile suit battles...\"",
  "\"What are you getting at?\"",
  "\"I'll be frank.",
  " ...Why not give Amuro-san",
  " the Mk-II?\"",
  "\"What!?\"",
  "\"He could make",
  " better use of the Mk-II.\"",
  "\"Did Amuro-san",
  " tell you to say that?\"",
  "\"No catch.",
  " But an Amuro Ray",
  " who doesn't fly a Gundam...\"",
  "\"Don't you think so too?\"",
  "\"Please get out of my way.\"",
  "\"Amuro-san",
  " is a hero of the One Year War.\"",
  "\"A hero ought to have",
  " a machine worthy of one.\"",
  "\"So it's not worthy of me,",
  " ...the Mk-II?\"",
  "\"I'm not talking",
  " about you!",
  " Do you dislike Amuro?\"",
  "\"I can't say I like him yet.\"",
  "\"This",
  " is for",
  " Amuro's own good.\"",
  "\"To help him",
  " get more confidence...\"",
  "\"Kamille!\"",
  "\"That's your sympathy talking.\"",
  "\"Pity like that...",
  " will get Amuro-san",
  " killed someday.\"",
  "Beltorchika",
  "was irritated by Kamille's words,",
  "yet at the same time she felt them",
  "pierce her heart",
  "with surprising force.",
  "The boy Kamille Bidan had a gaze",
  "that took in everything at once",
  "and hit the mark.",
  "That, perhaps,",
  "was the true mark",
  "of a Newtype.",
  "Having fought through",
  "the One Year War as heroes,",
  "the White Base crew",
  "were loudly hailed as heroes",
  "by the Earth Federation Forces.",
  "As symbols of the Newtype,",
  "bringers of human evolution,",
  "they were lionized",
  "by the press.",
  "But that did not",
  "make them happy.",
  "The Federation government",
  "feared that, with their charisma",
  "and their uncanny",
  "Newtype powers, they might",
  "threaten the Federation,",
  "and sought to keep them caged",
  "and idle within the system.",
  "But even that watch,",
  "after seven years,",
  "was coming apart at the seams.",
  "The bureaucrats, content to have",
  "built a system to confine them,",
  "simply forgot all about it.",
  "Bright Noa was made a Commander",
  "and captain of the Temptation,",
  "a shuttle running between",
  "Earth's Garuda transports",
  "and space.",
  "His rank was high, but in truth",
  "he was a mere chauffeur.",
  "It was, in effect, a sinecure.",
  "But after he criticized",
  "Bask Om over the theft",
  "of the Gundam Mk-II,",
  "he was seen as a nuisance,",
  "and when an attempt was made",
  "to kill him, Temptation and all,",
  "he joined the AEUG.",
  "Mirai Noa,",
  "nee Mirai Yashima,",
  "married Bright soon after the war.",
  "She all but cut her ties with",
  "the power of the Yashima family,",
  "her father's house, which had",
  "toiled for colony development;",
  "in officers' housing at Jaburo",
  "she bore two children, and lived,",
  "it seems, in loving harmony.",
  "Their son Hathaway once said,",
  "\"My parents live apart,",
  " on Earth and in space,",
  " yet their hearts are as one.\"",
  "So close were they.",
  "Bright had let her know",
  "that, should the moment come,",
  "he would side with the AEUG,",
  "and before Jaburo blew itself up",
  "she slipped past her watchers",
  "and fled to Hong Kong.",
  "After the war, Hayato Kobayashi",
  "became curator of a war museum",
  "not far from Kennedy Port.",
  "He took in Fraw Bow,",
  "who came to be known",
  "as Fraw Kobayashi,",
  "and Katz, Letz and Kikka,",
  "and he seems",
  "to have led",
  "a busy life.",
  "Yet, for all his plainness",
  "in the One Year War, he was",
  "the most dangerous man of all.",
  "Using his post as museum curator,",
  "he collected mobile suits, and his",
  "adopted son Katz could even say,",
  "\"I've piloted nearly every",
  " Zeon-type machine,\"",
  "so thorough was the training",
  "he gave him.",
  "His bringing the confined Amuro",
  "to the Audhumla through Katz,",
  "and his lightning union",
  "with the AEUG and armed uprising",
  "in North America,",
  "both speak to his skill",
  "as an underground organizer.",
  "He may not have been",
  "a gifted pilot, but",
  "he had risen to become",
  "a devilishly able",
  "resistance leader.",
  "That most of the Titans",
  "did not even know his name",
  "tells you as much.",
  "Kai Shiden, for a time, seems",
  "to have been a civil servant",
  "or a military employee,",
  "but he vanished from that life",
  "and became a freelance journalist.",
  "\"Never know when I'll be off",
  " to cover the Vatican.\"",
  "So went his catchphrase,",
  "half earnest, half joke,",
  "and from Siberia",
  "to South America",
  "he wore a pure white suit,",
  "a true dandy.",
  "He never joined",
  "Karaba himself,",
  "but kept supporting its work",
  "with information.",
  "Sayla Mass returned to the Mass",
  "family in southern Europe and,",
  "with the gold bars Char gave her",
  "as her capital, seems to have built",
  "a sizable fortune as an investor.",
  "Especially",
  "in the Mediterranean and Africa,",
  "she had a sizable network,",
  "and she backed the AEUG",
  "from the shadows.",
  "But she was even more wary",
  "of her brother, Char,",
  "and in the end she never took",
  "a stand in the AEUG herself.",
  "And Amuro Ray was posted where",
  "NORAD",
  "(North American",
  " Aerospace Defense",
  " Command)",
  "had once been based--",
  "Cheyenne Base.",
  "Cheyenne Base was an air defense",
  "command built in the medieval era",
  "called the Cold War, to withstand",
  "a nuclear attack,",
  "but now that Minovsky particles",
  "had come so far, it was pointless.",
  "Between his Haro patent",
  "and a commander-grade salary,",
  "he commuted by private plane",
  "and lived a life of luxury,",
  "but in truth he was a showpiece,",
  "kept fed and kept idle.",
  "Emma Sheen, as a student,",
  "met him on a trip with girlfriends,",
  "and in that ravaged era",
  "saw a young man living",
  "in remarkable luxury--",
  "that was the impression he left.",
  "North America had been",
  "utterly ravaged",
  "by the colony drop of 0083",
  "under Delaz,",
  "so it is no wonder she thought so.",
  "Of course, material fulfillment",
  "and spiritual fulfillment differ.",
  "Forbidden to go into space,",
  "and with no wish to go himself,",
  "he took a visit from his former",
  "girlfriend, Fraw, as his cue",
  "to join Karaba.",
  "Meanwhile,",
  "the pursuit of the Audhumla",
  "was left not to the regular Titans",
  "but to Federation troops drawn",
  "from the North American Army and",
  "transferred into the Titans, with",
  "the Newtype Lab's",
  "Cyber-Newtypes--a mixed unit,",
  "an independent band of misfits",
  "entrusted with the task.",
  "Manpower was short everywhere,",
  "but in the Titans' grand strategy",
  "of completing Gryps",
  "and keeping the Moon in check,",
  "forces to strike",
  "the AEUG's space fleet",
  "mattered more than the revenge",
  "for Jaburo,",
  "which was merely",
  "a matter of saving face.",
  "Command of that",
  "mixed unit",
  "went to a man named",
  "Bran Blutarch.",
  "He was not fond",
  "of the Titans,",
  "yet the people of space",
  "were his former enemies,",
  "so his feelings were complicated.",
  "He was a Lieutenant Commander,",
  "and for an officer outside",
  "any faction worth the name,",
  "he had risen uncannily high.",
  "Short-handed Zeon aside,",
  "a Federation field-grade officer",
  "still flying as an active pilot",
  "was a great rarity,",
  "and in that sense the man--",
  "a string of oddities and firsts--",
  "may fairly be called exceptional.",
  "Indeed, granted the gap",
  "in their machines' performance,",
  "flying his beloved Asshimar,",
  "he gave Kamille and Quattro",
  "a desperately hard fight.",
  "The only one who could beat him",
  "was, in fact, Amuro.",
  "That shows just how able he was.",
  "This Bran Blutarch,",
  "together with his subordinate",
  "and right-hand man, Ben Woodar,",
  "was spoiling for a fight.",
  "For field-bred Federation soldiers",
  "like Ben Woodar",
  "and Bran Blutarch,",
  "it looked like a golden opportunity",
  "for promotion.",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Murasame Lab, third shipment.",
  " This one's bringing",
  " a big mobile suit!\"",
  "Woodar",
  "\"The boosters from the last run--",
  " stow them in the nose!\"",
  "\"Why would they give us",
  " shuttle boosters, of all things?\"",
  "\"'Cause they're in the way, right?\"",
  "However,",
  "the cargo from the Murasame Lab",
  "went far past what they expected.",
  "\"Ugh...!",
  " It won't even fit in",
  " the Sudori's hangar...\"",
  "\"Heh heh...\"",
  "\"Good work.\"",
  "Four",
  "\"I'm Ensign Four Murasame.\"",
  "\"A woman...\"",
  "\"Lieutenant! I have a request.\"",
  "\"What is it?\"",
  "\"Once the mobile suits sortie,",
  " I'd like to be allowed",
  " to act as I see fit.\"",
  "\"What do you mean?\"",
  "\"I can't act on another's orders.",
  " Not I...\"",
  "\"Confidence is all well and good,",
  " but this is the military.\"",
  "\"If I can't have your permission,",
  " I'll go back to Japan.\"",
  "\"Heh heh heh... Very well.",
  " Do as you like.\"",
  "\"Thank you very much.\"",
  "The Newtype Lab was founded",
  "on Zeon's old Flanagan Institute",
  "and existing psychic institutes,",
  "organized in secret",
  "by the postwar Federation Forces.",
  "Officially, it was said to be",
  "researching new mobile suits,",
  "but inside, drugs,",
  "body modification",
  "and genetic engineering were used",
  "to develop Cyber-Newtypes.",
  "The Flanagan Institute",
  "was, in effect, a body",
  "that merely gathered Newtypes",
  "who had arisen naturally,",
  "whereas the Newtype Lab",
  "was born of the idea of creating",
  "Newtypes artificially and making",
  "them into the psycommu's",
  "living, biological",
  "components.",
  "So, unlike Zeon's institute,",
  "artificial Newtypes",
  "were treated as guinea pigs",
  "and referred to by code numbers.",
  "Mental trauma",
  "and environmental contamination",
  "were held to bring out Newtypes,",
  "so war orphans",
  "were rounded up",
  "and used as tools.",
  "But old-school soldiers",
  "shunned such conduct as",
  "\"crackpot researcher\" stuff",
  "or",
  "\"mad science\"",
  "and the like,",
  "and it drew their open",
  "displeasure.",
  "Rosamia",
  "\"The AEUG means to drop colonies",
  " and wipe out",
  " the people of Earth!\"",
  "\"A colony coming down...",
  " it's the sight of the sky itself",
  " falling down on you!\"",
  "Bran",
  "\"You're that convinced, Rosamia...?",
  " Seems even your memories",
  " have been enhanced...\"",
  "\"Every night...",
  " I dream that the sky is falling!\"",
  "\"All right. You may sortie.\"",
  "\"Thank you, sir!\"",
  "(Hmph,",
  " even Cyber-Newtypes need",
  " flattering to be of use, eh...)",
  "And so the Sudori unit",
  "stormed the Audhumla,",
  "at anchor in New Hong Kong.",
  "Leading the charge",
  "was the Psycho Gundam.",
  "\"Why",
  " didn't you finish off the Mk-II?",
  " ...Too sure of yourself?\"",
  "\"You're not in the Psycho Gundam--",
  " you can't know how vile it feels!\"",
  "\"Could you understand!? You!?",
  " Like a snake writhing",
  " inside your head!\"",
  "\"If you did, could you bear it!?",
  " That... that feeling!\"",
  "\"The Psycho Gundam...",
  " can we really use it?\"",
  "For the first time, Ben Woodar",
  "felt uneasy about the Titans,",
  "the organization on which",
  "he had staked his ambitions."
 ]
}
